title Procure to pay
direction right

Procure [icon: shopping-cart] {
  Need identified [shape: oval, color: green]
  Raise a requisition
  Approved? [shape: diamond, color: purple]
  On contract? [shape: diamond, color: purple]
  Source a supplier
  Issue the order [color: purple]
  Declined [shape: oval, color: red]
}

Pay [icon: credit-card] {
  Receive the goods
  Invoice arrives [shape: oval, color: blue]
  Match the invoice
  Pay the supplier
  Paid and closed [shape: oval]
}

Need identified > Raise a requisition > Approved?
Approved? > On contract?: Yes
Approved? > Declined: No
On contract? > Source a supplier: No
On contract? > Issue the order: Yes
Source a supplier > Issue the order
Issue the order > Receive the goods: The supplier ships
Receive the goods > Invoice arrives > Match the invoice > Pay the supplier > Paid and closed
